{"id":"where-the-time-goes","title":"Where the time goes","question":"Which desks hold a permit longest, and is the time spent waiting or reviewing?","finding":"A full-review building permit filed since 2015 passed through a median 5 technical review stations in 4 departments, and 65% were put on hold at least once (median 106 days on hold). Of the days plans sat at a station, 35% passed before a reviewer started. The three stations with the most plan-days were Planning Department zoning check, Building plan check and Permit processing center (routes the plans). On jobs of $1 million to $20 million, plans reached building plan check a median 52 days after filing, the Fire Department after 82, and the water and street desks only after 159 and 162: the stations are mostly visited one after another.","how":"Every routing step of full-review alteration permits and new buildings filed since 2015: days from arriving at a station to finishing there; the wait is the part before the recorded start. Repeat visits are permits sent to the same station more than once for the same set of drawings. 'Share of plan-days' is that station's days divided by all station days.","limits":"Stations often review at the same time, so station days overlap and cannot be added into calendar days. The start date is entered by staff and is used differently outside Building Inspection. The system does not separate days waiting on the City from days waiting on the applicant to answer comments; the Budget Analyst reported in March 2026 that the City's system cannot tell the two apart without reading each file.","tier":"REDFLAG","columns":[{"k":"station","t":"Review station","type":"text"},{"k":"dept","t":"Department","type":"text"},{"k":"permits","t":"Permits routed here","type":"int"},{"k":"perPermit","t":"Visits per permit","type":"times"},{"k":"repeat","t":"Share sent back at least once","type":"pct"},{"k":"median","t":"Median days per visit","type":"int"},{"k":"p90","t":"Slowest tenth took at least (days)","type":"int"},{"k":"waitShare","t":"Share of days before review started","type":"pct"},{"k":"holds","t":"Holds placed","type":"int"},{"k":"shareDays","t":"Share of all plan-days","type":"pct"}],"rows":[{"station":"Planning Department zoning check","code":"CP-ZOC","dept":"Planning","desk":false,"permits":17041,"steps":32368,"perPermit":1.9,"median":18.0,"p90":399,"totalDays":4296093,"shareDays":0.267,"waitShare":0.476,"holds":6223,"comments":1760,"repeat":0.527},{"station":"Building plan check","code":"BLDG","dept":"Building Inspection","desk":false,"permits":18368,"steps":44765,"perPermit":2.44,"median":18,"p90":167,"totalDays":2751686,"shareDays":0.171,"waitShare":0.371,"holds":12511,"comments":9202,"repeat":0.581},{"station":"Permit processing center (routes the plans)","code":"PPC","dept":"Building Inspection","desk":true,"permits":21066,"steps":28476,"perPermit":1.35,"median":0.0,"p90":217,"totalDays":1841666,"shareDays":0.114,"waitShare":0.053,"holds":637,"comments":0,"repeat":0.022},{"station":"Central Permit Bureau (issuing desk)","code":"CPB","dept":"Building Inspection","desk":true,"permits":22777,"steps":56983,"perPermit":2.5,"median":1.0,"p90":55,"totalDays":1710511,"shareDays":0.106,"waitShare":0.196,"holds":678,"comments":4,"repeat":1.123},{"station":"Fire Department plan check","code":"SFFD","dept":"Fire","desk":false,"permits":13406,"steps":27391,"perPermit":2.04,"median":7,"p90":116,"totalDays":1169341,"shareDays":0.073,"waitShare":0.382,"holds":5447,"comments":4208,"repeat":0.488},{"station":"Public Works street-use and mapping","code":"DPW-BSM","dept":"Public Works","desk":false,"permits":12713,"steps":27556,"perPermit":2.17,"median":5.0,"p90":103,"totalDays":1113320,"shareDays":0.069,"waitShare":0.182,"holds":6321,"comments":2127,"repeat":0.462},{"station":"Mechanical plan check","code":"MECH","dept":"Building Inspection","desk":false,"permits":12960,"steps":23038,"perPermit":1.78,"median":8.0,"p90":101,"totalDays":941846,"shareDays":0